.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-openpgp-cardholder-set-url 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-openpgp\-cardholder\-set\-url \- Set the public\-key URL (at most 255 bytes; empty clears it)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-openpgp\-cardholder\-set\-url\fR [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIURL\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the public\-key URL (at most 255 bytes; empty clears it)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR \fI<ADMIN_PIN>\fR
Admin PIN (prompted when omitted)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIURL\fR>
The URL pointing at the public key
